  "notes": "v0.25.3: refitted to four BigSoundBank door creaks (#3206, #3208-#3210; hold-out #3205, #3207, #3211: loss 9.0 -> 4.6). The v0.25 creak had jittery cycles (smeared harmonics), a dull spectrum (centroid 430 Hz vs ~1050 Hz real) and no formant: the cycles smeared into a zipper-like rasp instead of a groan. Now: short slips (a sharp harmonic series), the hinge/door resonance at ~1.5 kHz ringing longer. wander set to 0.5 after the fit (hold-out loss 4.0; the fitted 0.88 made the 2-4 kHz level jagged, envelope kurtosis 0.7 vs -0.35 median real)."
